IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg5-s232-s233-delivery-of-notice`

-- Tests of dg5-s232-s233-delivery-of-notice.l4 (8 Del. C. ss 232 and 233).
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text (src:971-999 of de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt), beside the assertion.
-- A test builds a notice with the helper below; the parameters are, in order:
--   way, directed to the address on the records, mail date, received date, left-at-address date, electronic date,
--   posting date, separate-notice date, legend, objected to electronic mail, consented to the form, revoked the consent,
--   fax number consented, date from which electronic notice is barred.

GIVEN w IS A `dg5 s 232 Way a notice is given`
      rec IS A BOOLEAN
      dm IS A MAYBE DATE
      dr IS A MAYBE DATE
      dl IS A MAYBE DATE
      de IS A MAYBE DATE
      dp IS A MAYBE DATE
      ds IS A MAYBE DATE
      lg IS A BOOLEAN
      ob IS A BOOLEAN
      co IS A BOOLEAN
      rv IS A BOOLEAN
      fx IS A BOOLEAN
      bar IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `dg5 s 232 Notice given to a stockholder`
`dg5 test notice` w rec dm dr dl de dp ds lg ob co rv fx bar MEANS
    `dg5 s 232 Notice given to a stockholder` WITH
          `the way the notice was given` IS w
        , `the notice is directed to the address on the corporation's records` IS rec
        , `the date the notice was deposited in the U.S. mail` IS dm
        , `the date the notice was received by the stockholder` IS dr
        , `the date the notice was left at the stockholder's address` IS dl
        , `the date the notice was directed to the stockholder by electronic transmission` IS de
        , `the date of the posting on the electronic network` IS dp
        , `the date of the separate notice of the posting` IS ds
        , `the electronic mail carries a prominent legend that it is an important notice regarding the corporation` IS lg
        , `the stockholder has notified the corporation of an objection to receiving notice by electronic mail` IS ob
        , `the stockholder consented to receive notice by that form of electronic transmission` IS co
        , `the stockholder has revoked that consent` IS rv
        , `the facsimile number is one at which the stockholder consented to receive notice` IS fx
        , `the date from which notice by electronic transmission is barred` IS bar

§ `Section 232(a)(1) -- mail: given when deposited in the U.S. mail`

-- Mailed to the address on the records on 10 March 2026: given on 10 March 2026.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by mail deposited in the U.S. mail with postage prepaid` TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)
-- Not directed to the address on the records: section 232(a) does not make the notice effective.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by mail deposited in the U.S. mail with postage prepaid` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 232(a)(2) -- courier: the earlier of received and left at the address`

-- Received on 12 March, left at the address on 11 March: the earlier, 11 March.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by courier service` TRUE NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12)) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11)) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11)
-- Received on 11 March, left at the address on 12 March: the earlier, 11 March.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by courier service` TRUE NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11)) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12)) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11)
-- Only received (never left at the address): the date received.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by courier service` TRUE NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12)) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12)
-- Neither received nor left: nothing yet given.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by courier service` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Same day for both: that day.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by courier service` TRUE NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11)) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11)) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11)

§ `Section 232(a)(3) -- electronic mail`

-- Directed to the address on the records, with the legend, no objection, no bar: given when directed.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)
-- No legend: not given by electronic mail under section 232(a).
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The stockholder objected to receiving notice by electronic mail.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not directed to the address on the records.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address` FALSE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The bar of section 232(e) starts on 10 March: an e-mail directed on 10 March is barred (from and after), one on 9 March is not.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10))) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 9)) NOTHING NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10))) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 9)
-- No consent is needed for electronic mail given under subsection (a): consent false, still given.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)

§ `Section 232(c)(1) -- facsimile`

-- Directed to a number at which the stockholder consented: given when directed.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by facsimile telecommunication directed to a number` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)
-- Not a number the stockholder consented to.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by facsimile telecommunication directed to a number` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Consent revoked (section 232(b): "revocable by the stockholder").
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by facsimile telecommunication directed to a number` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Barred by section 232(e).
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by facsimile telecommunication directed to a number` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1))) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 232(c)(2) -- a posting with separate notice: the later of the two`

-- Posted 10 March, separate notice 12 March: given on 12 March.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by a posting on an electronic network together with separate notice of that posting` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12)) FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12)
-- Separate notice 10 March, posted 12 March: given on 12 March.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by a posting on an electronic network together with separate notice of that posting` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12)) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12)
-- No separate notice: not given by this way.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by a posting on an electronic network together with separate notice of that posting` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- No consent to a posting.
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by a posting on an electronic network together with separate notice of that posting` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12)) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 232(c)(3) -- any other electronic transmission`

#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by any other form of electronic transmission directed to the stockholder` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by any other form of electronic transmission directed to the stockholder` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by any other form of electronic transmission directed to the stockholder` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 232 the date on which the notice is given` (`dg5 test notice` `by any other form of electronic transmission directed to the stockholder` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10))) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 232(e) -- when notice by electronic transmission is barred`

-- Two consecutive notices could not be delivered and the inability became known on 5 March: the bar starts on 5 March.
#ASSERT `s 232(e) the date from which notice by electronic transmission is barred` TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 5)) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 5)
-- The corporation was able to deliver: no bar.
#ASSERT `s 232(e) the date from which notice by electronic transmission is barred` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 5)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Unable to deliver but the inability has not become known to the secretary or the transfer agent: no bar yet.
#ASSERT `s 232(e) the date from which notice by electronic transmission is barred` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- The proviso: an inadvertent failure to discover the inability does not invalidate any meeting or other action.
#ASSERT `s 232(e) the meeting or other action is invalidated by the failure to discover the inability` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The text does not say what follows from a failure to discover that was not inadvertent: not covered.
#ASSERT `s 232(e) the meeting or other action is invalidated by the failure to discover the inability` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 232(d) -- the three definitions`

#ASSERT `s 232(d)(1) the communication is an electronic transmission` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(d)(1) the communication is an electronic transmission` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(d)(1) the communication is an electronic transmission` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(d)(1) the communication is an electronic transmission` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 232(d)(3) the destination is an electronic mail address` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(d)(3) the destination is an electronic mail address` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(d)(3) the destination is an electronic mail address` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(d)(3) the destination is an electronic mail address` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 232(d)(2) the communication is electronic mail` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(d)(2) the communication is electronic mail` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(d)(2) the communication is electronic mail` FALSE TRUE)
-- Attached files are always deemed included; hyperlinked information only if the e-mail gives the contact information of an officer or agent who can assist.
#ASSERT `s 232(d)(2) the matter is deemed included in the electronic mail` `a file attached to the electronic mail` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(d)(2) the matter is deemed included in the electronic mail` `information hyperlinked to a website from the electronic mail` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(d)(2) the matter is deemed included in the electronic mail` `information hyperlinked to a website from the electronic mail` FALSE)

§ `Section 232(f) to (h)`

#ASSERT `s 232(f) the affidavit is prima facie evidence of the facts stated in it` TRUE TRUE FALSE
-- Fraud: no prima facie effect ("in the absence of fraud").
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(f) the affidavit is prima facie evidence of the facts stated in it` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(f) the affidavit is prima facie evidence of the facts stated in it` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(f) the affidavit is prima facie evidence of the facts stated in it` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- Section 232(g): a document enclosed with a mailed or couriered notice is part of the notice; not so for e-mail.
#ASSERT `s 232(g) the document is deemed part of the notice for the purpose of deciding whether notice was duly given` `by mail deposited in the U.S. mail with postage prepaid` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 232(g) the document is deemed part of the notice for the purpose of deciding whether notice was duly given` `by courier service` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(g) the document is deemed part of the notice for the purpose of deciding whether notice was duly given` `by electronic mail directed to the stockholder's electronic mail address` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(g) the document is deemed part of the notice for the purpose of deciding whether notice was duly given` `by courier service` FALSE)
-- Section 232(h): for sections 164, 296, 311, 312 and 324 only paragraphs (a)(1), (d)(2) and (d)(3) apply.
#ASSERT `s 232(h) the provision of section 232 applies to the notice` `paragraph (a)(1) of section 232` 164
#ASSERT `s 232(h) the provision of section 232 applies to the notice` `paragraph (d)(2) of section 232` 296
#ASSERT `s 232(h) the provision of section 232 applies to the notice` `paragraph (d)(3) of section 232` 324
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(h) the provision of section 232 applies to the notice` `another provision of section 232` 311)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 232(h) the provision of section 232 applies to the notice` `another provision of section 232` 312)
#ASSERT `s 232(h) the provision of section 232 applies to the notice` `another provision of section 232` 222
#ASSERT `s 232(h) the provision of section 232 applies to the notice` `another provision of section 232` 163
#ASSERT `s 232(h) the provision of section 232 applies to the notice` `another provision of section 232` 165

§ `Section 233 -- a single written notice for stockholders who share an address`

-- Consented and not revoked: effective as to that stockholder.
#ASSERT `s 233(a) the single written notice is effective as to the stockholder` (`dg5 s 233 Stockholder at a shared address` WITH `the stockholder consented to the single written notice` IS TRUE, `the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice under s 233(b)` IS FALSE, `the stockholder revoked that consent by written notice to the corporation` IS FALSE)
-- Deemed to have consented under subsection (b): effective.
#ASSERT `s 233(a) the single written notice is effective as to the stockholder` (`dg5 s 233 Stockholder at a shared address` WITH `the stockholder consented to the single written notice` IS FALSE, `the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice under s 233(b)` IS TRUE, `the stockholder revoked that consent by written notice to the corporation` IS FALSE)
-- Revoked by written notice: not effective.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 233(a) the single written notice is effective as to the stockholder` (`dg5 s 233 Stockholder at a shared address` WITH `the stockholder consented to the single written notice` IS TRUE, `the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice under s 233(b)` IS FALSE, `the stockholder revoked that consent by written notice to the corporation` IS TRUE))
-- Neither consented nor deemed: not effective.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 233(a) the single written notice is effective as to the stockholder` (`dg5 s 233 Stockholder at a shared address` WITH `the stockholder consented to the single written notice` IS FALSE, `the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice under s 233(b)` IS FALSE, `the stockholder revoked that consent by written notice to the corporation` IS FALSE))

`dg5 test consenting stockholder` MEANS `dg5 s 233 Stockholder at a shared address` WITH `the stockholder consented to the single written notice` IS TRUE, `the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice under s 233(b)` IS FALSE, `the stockholder revoked that consent by written notice to the corporation` IS FALSE
`dg5 test revoking stockholder` MEANS `dg5 s 233 Stockholder at a shared address` WITH `the stockholder consented to the single written notice` IS TRUE, `the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice under s 233(b)` IS FALSE, `the stockholder revoked that consent by written notice to the corporation` IS TRUE

-- Effective only if every stockholder at the address to whom it is given consented ("consented to by the stockholders at that address").
#ASSERT `s 233(a) the single written notice is effective for all the stockholders at the address` (LIST `dg5 test consenting stockholder`, `dg5 test consenting stockholder`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 233(a) the single written notice is effective for all the stockholders at the address` (LIST `dg5 test consenting stockholder`, `dg5 test revoking stockholder`))

-- Section 233(b): the corporation gave written notice of its intention on 1 January 2026; 60 days after that is 2 March 2026 (1 January + 31 = 1 February; + 28 = 1 March; + 1 = 2 March).
#ASSERT `the date` (`period in days` 60) `after` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 3 2
-- Objected in writing on day 60 (2 March): in time, so not deemed to have consented.
#ASSERT `s 233(b) the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 2)) (YearMonthDay 2026 4 1) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Objected on day 61 (3 March): out of time, so deemed to have consented.
#ASSERT `s 233(b) the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 3)) (YearMonthDay 2026 4 1) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Never objected and asked after the 60 days (3 March): deemed to have consented.
#ASSERT `s 233(b) the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 3) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Never objected but asked on day 60 itself (2 March): the period has not yet run, so the text does not yet deem consent.
#ASSERT `s 233(b) the stockholder is deemed to have consented to the single written notice` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2026 3 2) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Section 233(d): the section does not apply to notices under sections 164, 296, 311, 312 and 324.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 233(d) section 233 applies to the notice` 164)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 233(d) section 233 applies to the notice` 296)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 233(d) section 233 applies to the notice` 311)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 233(d) section 233 applies to the notice` 312)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 233(d) section 233 applies to the notice` 324)
#ASSERT `s 233(d) section 233 applies to the notice` 222
#ASSERT `s 233(d) section 233 applies to the notice` 325
